# App Router

Every route sits under `src/app/[lang]/`. URLs are `/en`, `/de`, `/pt`, `/es`, `/ar`.

`src/app/[lang]/layout.tsx` is the root layout: set `<html lang dir>`. Do not add `src/app/layout.tsx` with those tags.

```tsx
<html
  lang={localeMeta[lang].htmlLang}
  dir={getLocaleDirection(lang)}
  style={toCssVars(settings.theme)}
>
```

Use `LayoutProps<'/[lang]'>` and `PageProps<'/[lang]'>`. `generateStaticParams` must emit all `locales` from config.

Locale prefixing is `src/proxy.ts` (Next.js 16 Proxy), not `middleware.ts`.

Invalid `lang` → `notFound()`. Pass copy into templates as props; do not import JSON in Client Components. Theme CSS vars come from `getSettings()` on `<html>`. Pages and chrome are mobile-first (`min-w-0`, wrap, `md:` type/spacing). If this summary changes, update `CLAUDE.md` Layout in the same turn.
